    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gentle Golem is a relaxing open world exploration game inspired by Zelda and PowerWash Simulator! Clean up the corruption that's encroaching on your home! Grow plants to help you traverse, or just grow pretty ones! Explore the Cloudlands at your own pace. Can you uncover its mysteries?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/20f04e73abe14cb80488843962ddfc13.poster.avif?t=1749464234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/20f04e73abe14cb80488843962ddfc13.webm?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/20f04e73abe14cb80488843962ddfc13.mp4?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow plants on any surface!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean away the corruption that affect flora and fauna alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow plants to help you explore, or just grow pretty ones!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is your creator? Where are they?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/3735c967141d31d242d1068c53f41438.poster.avif?t=1749464234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/3735c967141d31d242d1068c53f41438.webm?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/3735c967141d31d242d1068c53f41438.mp4?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/26e0a1ce7f8b56db588b2da57f873908.poster.avif?t=1749464234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/26e0a1ce7f8b56db588b2da57f873908.webm?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/26e0a1ce7f8b56db588b2da57f873908.mp4?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gentle Golem is a relaxing open world exploration game inspired by Zelda and PowerWash Simulator! Clean up the corruption that's encroaching on your home! Grow plants to help you traverse, or just grow pretty ones! Explore the Cloudlands at your own pace. Can you uncover its mysteries?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/20f04e73abe14cb80488843962ddfc13.poster.avif?t=1749464234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/20f04e73abe14cb80488843962ddfc13.webm?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/20f04e73abe14cb80488843962ddfc13.mp4?t=1749464234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow plants on any surface!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean away the corruption that affect flora and fauna alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow plants to help you explore, or just grow pretty ones!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is your creator? Where are they?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/extras/3735c967141d31d242d1068c53f41438.poster.avif?t=1749464234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1